<h2>Pustaka lanjutan</h2>
<ul>
<li>R. Fagin, J. Y. Halpern, Y. Moses, dan M. Y. Vardi. Reasoning about Knowledge, The MIT Press, 1995.</li>
<li>Lewis, David. Convention: A philosophical study. Harvard University Press, 1969.</li>
